OL,3,GNEWSAIrish government minister
OL,4,Acriticises rape crisis centre consent
OL,5,Aad
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Irish minister for justice has
OL,8,Fcriticised an advertisement produced by
OL,9,Fthe Dublin Rape Crisis Centre (DRCC)
OL,10,Fpromoting consent, calling it
OL,11,F"inappropriate and demeaning to
OL,12,Fgrandparents".
OL,14,FThe ad depicts two grandparents
OL,15,Fenthusiastically hugging a young boy,
OL,16,Fbut when they approach their
OL,17,Fgranddaughter she appears unhappy about
OL,18,Fthe exchange.
OL,20,FIt includes the message "not everyone
OL,21,Fwants a hug. Even from the people who
OL,22,Flove them".
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
